---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
---
<Base title="Grievance Redressal | Prodory" description="How to raise a grievance about how AO Plus Solutions handles your personal data, under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023." path="/legal/grievance/">
  <article class="wrap section !py-16 max-w-3xl">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950">Grievance redressal</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm muted">Last updated: 24 November 2026</p>
    <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">If you have a concern about how {SITE.parent} handles your personal data on the Prodory website or in an enquiry, raise it with our grievance officer.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">Grievance officer</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">{SITE.parent}<br />{SITE.head.line1}, {SITE.head.line2}, {SITE.head.line3}<br />Email: grievance@aoplus.in<br />Phone: {SITE.phone}</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">What to include</h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 grid list-disc gap-2 pl-5 text-slate-700">
      <li>your name, and the email address or phone number you used with us;</li>
      <li>the date of your enquiry, if you sent one;</li>
      <li>what you are asking us to do, such as correcting, erasing or stopping use of your data.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">What happens next</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">We acknowledge your grievance and respond without undue delay. If you are not satisfied with our response, or you do not receive one, you may complain to the Data Protection Board of India under the DPDP Act, 2023.</p>

    <p class="mt-10 text-sm muted">See also the <a class="underline" href="/legal/privacy/">privacy notice</a> and the <a class="underline" href="/legal/terms/">terms of use</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
